Kurayami de no zetsubou mo douka kowagaranaide
Please, don't be frightened of despair in the darkness

00:22:15.330 --> 00:22:21.750
Anata no mune itsudatte tobosu yume ga aru kara
The shining dream in your heart will always light your way

00:22:21.750 --> 00:22:28.210
Ketsudan e no sadame ni doukoku shita genjitsu
There's a lamenting truth in the fate of your decision

00:22:28.210 --> 00:22:31.460
Dakedo sore wa ai yue no
