La la, la la la La la, la la la

00:22:39.580 --> 00:22:42.670
Tobeyo houyoku no violet
Let your violet phoenix wings take flight

00:22:42.670 --> 00:22:45.750
Hi no tori no you ni
Like a fire bird

00:22:45.750 --> 00:22:51.540
We are... Nandomo utai tsuyoku natta yume wa makenai
We are... Sing it over and over, a strengthened dream will never lose

00:22:51.540 --> 00:22:55.420
Anata o tsuterete ikitainda
I want to take you with me

00:22:55.420 --> 00:22:58.750
